      "majorComponents": 20,
      "prompt": "Create a NEW original transparent-alpha carry WOOD sprite sheet for our historical 2D isometric RTS, using the attached original five-civilization sack-carry sheet solely for exact character/clothing/material/camera references.\nTRUE RGBA PNG with EXACTLY4columns by5rows,20isolated complete figures. Orthographic30degree isometric game camera, same mature realistic adult anatomy and detailed linen/wool/leather as reference, soft upper-left lighting. No toy/cartoon/paper doll look. No background, floor islands, grid, text, labels, modern objects or watermark. Wide safe fully transparent gutters, whole boots/hands/load inside each cell.\nColumns ALWAYS SE front facing lower-right, SW front lower-left, NE true back upper-right, NW true back upper-left. Rotate FULL character and wood load.\nEvery actor WALKING HOME CARRYING WOOD: replace the sack with a COMPACT BUNDLE of three or four SHORT roughly cut logs/firewood pieces tied securely with brown rope, held naturally across forearms at waist or resting on one shoulder supported by one hand. Clearly show cut circular log ends, warm wood grain, dark bark, rope ties. Load fits the worker's proportions, is not giant. No sack, food or basket. One leg naturally forward, other behind, all limbs connected normally. Four views of same load/clothing/identity.\nRows EXACT order matching reference:\n1 Roman Mediterranean man, off-white knee-length linen tunic, short dark hair/beard, brown belt and sandals.\n2 Mongol Central Asian man, beige wool deel, small fur-edged cap, brown trousers and boots.\n3 Persian West Asian man, rust-brown long tunic with understated gold hem, plain soft flat cap, trousers and boots.\n4 Tang East Asian man, muted blue-gray tunic, dark brown trousers/boots, brown belt, black tied topknot.\n5 Ottoman West Asian man, cream linen tunic/trousers, modest white headwrap and dark red cap, brown belt/boots.\nPreserve the original physical body/head proportions and tactile materials. No loose resource objects beside people. No detached tools or hands. Fully isolated sprites with alpha0 all outside figures and carried timber; only tiny faint contact shadows.",
